{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kfSDqEJEeM1794482181.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英超曼聯宣布辭退領隊卡域克，結束半年「紅魔」領隊生涯。</p><p></p><p>曼聯發聲明表示，經歷失望的開季，會方得出異常艱難的決定，希望令球隊重回正軌，同時讚揚對方，無論過去還是未來，永遠是曼聯傳奇。</p><p></p><p>45歲的卡域克上季暫代被炒的艾摩廉，以英超第三完成，重返歐聯，五月正式「坐正」，但曼聯今季成績欠佳，暫排尾三。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.092216+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:07:16.592302+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:17.012894+00:00","content_hash":"a43afb8ba5d85fc4fde6dc1f002494c42c9686613df748b435d4d584d269d2f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.092216+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}